1
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:17,880
God's victorious!

2
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:31,920
Your mighty right hand, O Lord full of power

3
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:39,010
It shatters the foe, in judgment devoured

4
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:45,630
Your majesty's great, You rise and prevail

5
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:52,880
Your fury consumes; the wicked assail

6
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:56,680
The enemy boasted, “I’ll chase and destroy,

7
00:00:56,680 --> 00:01:00,150
I’ll take what I want and carry my ploy

8
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:03,260
I’ll draw my sharp sword and bring them to shame”

9
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:10,140
But You blew Your wind; they sank at Your name

10
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:17,240
God's victorious, His people He saved

11
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:23,920
God's victorious, no more enslaved

12
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:35,280
God's victorious, the rivals He razed

13
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:50,910
God's victorious, triumphant and worthy of praise

14
00:01:54,770 --> 00:02:00,980
The nations have heard and trembled with fear,

15
00:02:01,490 --> 00:02:08,090
They shake and they scatter as judgment draws near

16
00:02:08,090 --> 00:02:14,750
Dread and great terror fall down from Your throne

17
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:22,220
They freeze before You, like a rigid stone

18
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:25,680
You'll bring Your people with sovereign grace

19
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,730
You'll plant their feet in Your dwelling place

20
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:32,060
The mountain You formed, Your holy abode

21
00:02:32,060 --> 00:02:38,910
There You will reign, with glory untold

22
00:02:38,910 --> 00:02:46,120
God's victorious, His people He saved

23
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:52,820
God's victorious, no more enslaved

24
00:02:52,820 --> 00:03:04,330
God's victorious, the rivals He razed

25
00:03:04,330 --> 00:03:19,460
God's victorious, triumphant and worthy of praise

26
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:31,150
Who is like You, O Lord on high?

27
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:38,040
In power majestic, none can deny

28
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:43,980
Awesome in wonders, Your name is renowned,

29
00:03:43,980 --> 00:03:54,390
You stretched out Your hand, the enemy drowned

30
00:03:54,390 --> 00:04:01,800
God's victorious, His people He saved

31
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:08,350
God's victorious, no more enslaved

32
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:19,710
God's victorious, the rivals He razed

33
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:30,370
God's victorious, triumphant and worthy of praise

34
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:39,040
Triumphant and worthy of praise

35
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:44,460
God's victorious

36
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:53,150
He's victorious,

37
00:04:53,150 --> 00:04:58,920
Victorious!
